:null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1stable unknown - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sun, 23 Mar 2025 17:17:30 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 (nvidia; 570.133.07) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7400 CPU @ 3.00GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen an error is raised in the text shader editor, if the error text is **multi-line** and long enough, it expands so much vertically that it hides the code editor.\n\nThis can happen when a shader include path is not complete and lacks the closing `\"`.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0e45bd8-35b8-48e7-a170-ddb92097a85b)\n\nSUSPECT N°1 :\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/594d64ec244b6b99321e2096987d4d69de4c8845/editor/code_editor.cpp#L1870\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a shader with several lines (60+)\n2. Start writing an `#include \"path` at the top of the file but don't write the ending `\"`   \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19489012/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gith